Hi all,

I just want to ask around if anyone already experimented or is going
to experiment with Xenomai/Adeos on Freescale iMX53x processors?

I know that these processors are only added to the mainline kernel
since version 2.6.38, while Adeos only supports ARM up to 2.6.35. And
I'm not sure how similar the iMX53x processors are to the iMX51 with
respect to the Adeos patch.

But if anyone has any information on this topic then please let me know.

Else we'll wait evaluating this processor until there is an ARM Adeos
patch available for 2.6.39 and will use the Xenomai ARM porting guide
to bring-up Xenomai on that processor.

Thanks,
Henri

